<title>HONG KONG: Pam &amp; Frank interim net loss HK$29.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Pam &amp; Frank interim net loss HK$29.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	7.0 loss    vs  4.3 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents) nil	   vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     2.55 loss   vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			 29.77 loss  vs  18.38 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		  266.03	vs  496.00</p>
<p>    Company name	    Pam &amp; Frank International Holdings</p>
<p>				  Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close	     N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Pam &amp; Frank International makes sports bags.</p>
<p>The exceptional item represents financial restructuring fees incurred during the period.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
